<rss version="2.0" xmlns:dc="http://purl.org/dc/elements/1.1/"><channel><title>出版物 |皮尤研究中心</title><link>https://www.pewresearch.org/publications/</link><description></description><lastBuildDate>Fri, 31 Jul 2026 13:27:14 GMT</lastBuildDate><generator>rfeed v1.1.1</generator><docs>https://github.com/svpino/rfeed/blob/master/README.md</docs><item><title>最高法院的赞成率仍接近历史低点</title><link>https://www.pewresearch.org/short-reads/2026/07/30/favorable-views-of-supreme-court-remain-near-historic-low/</link><description>目前，一半的美国人对最高法院持负面看法，而大约有一半的美国人对最高法院持正面看法。由 PolitePaul 服务提供</description><pubDate>Fri, 31 Jul 2026 01:32:17 GMT</pubDate><guid isPermaLink="true">https://www.pewresearch.org/short-reads/2026/07/30/favorable-views-of-supreme-court-remain-near-historic-low/</guid></item><item><title>皮尤研究中心如何在我们的工作中使用人工智能（以及没有使用人工智能）</title><link>https://www.pewresearch.org/decoded/2026/07/30/how-pew-research-center-is-and-is-not-using-ai-in-our-work-2/</link><description>在这篇文章中，我们将分享当前人工智能内部使用指南和潜在的实验领域。由 PolitePaul 服务提供</description><pubDate>Fri, 31 Jul 2026 01:17:17 GMT</pubDate><guid isPermaLink="true">https://www.pewresearch.org/decoded/2026/07/30/how-pew-research-center-is-and-is-not-using-ai-in-our-work-2/</guid></item><item><title>视频：民意调查到底有多精确？</title><link>https://www.pewresearch.org/methods/2026/07/29/video-how-precise-are-polls-really/</link><description>民意调查到底有多精确？考特尼·肯尼迪告诉我们一个小秘密：即使是最好的民意调查机构在分享结果时也需要一些回旋余地。这个“回旋余地”（也称为误差幅度）是真实答案可能落入的范围。  由 PolitePaul 服务提供</description><pubDate>Thu, 30 Jul 2026 01:16:54 GMT</pubDate><guid isPermaLink="true">https://www.pewresearch.org/methods/2026/07/29/video-how-precise-are-polls-really/</guid></item><item><title>现在支持全日制学校手机禁令的美国人多于反对者</title><link>https://www.pewresearch.org/short-reads/2026/07/29/more-americans-now-support-than-oppose-all-day-school-cellphone-bans/</link><description>四分之三的美国成年人支持学校在课堂上禁止使用手机，现在支持中学生全天禁止使用手机的人数首次超过了反对者。由 PolitePaul 服务提供</description><pubDate>Thu, 30 Jul 2026 01:01:54 GMT</pubDate><guid isPermaLink="true">https://www.pewresearch.org/short-reads/2026/07/29/more-americans-now-support-than-oppose-all-day-school-cellphone-bans/</guid></item><item><title>大多数美国人赞成对政治制度进行重大改革，这可能需要修改宪法</title><link>https://www.pewresearch.org/short-reads/2026/07/28/most-americans-favor-big-changes-to-the-political-system-that-likely-would-require-amending-the-constitution/</link><description>大多数美国人支持任期限制、竞选支出上限和选举团改革，但实现这些改变可能需要修改世界上最难改变的宪法之一。由 PolitePaul 服务提供</description><pubDate>Wed, 29 Jul 2026 01:23:43 GMT</pubDate><guid isPermaLink="true">https://www.pewresearch.org/short-reads/2026/07/28/most-americans-favor-big-changes-to-the-political-system-that-likely-would-require-amending-the-constitution/</guid></item><item><title>加拿大人和墨西哥人现在对中国的看法比美国更积极</title><link>https://www.pewresearch.org/short-reads/2026/07/27/canadians-and-mexicans-now-view-china-more-positively-than-the-us/</link><description>加拿大人和墨西哥人现在对中国国家主席习近平的看法也比特朗普更加积极，尽管两国相对较少的人对两位领导人有信心。由 PolitePaul 服务提供</description><pubDate>Tue, 28 Jul 2026 01:23:05 GMT</pubDate><guid isPermaLink="true">https://www.pewresearch.org/short-reads/2026/07/27/canadians-and-mexicans-now-view-china-more-positively-than-the-us/</guid></item><item><title>美国人对全球人工智能竞赛的看法</title><link>https://www.pewresearch.org/short-reads/2026/07/23/what-americans-think-about-the-global-ai-race/</link><description>大多数美国人认为中国在人工智能发展方面比美国更先进，而43%的人表示美国在人工智能方面的领导地位极其或非常重要。由 PolitePaul 服务提供</description><pubDate>Fri, 24 Jul 2026 07:55:35 GMT</pubDate><guid isPermaLink="true">https://www.pewresearch.org/short-reads/2026/07/23/what-americans-think-about-the-global-ai-race/</guid></item><item><title>随着 2026 年中期选举的临近，经济是重中之重</title><link>https://www.pewresearch.org/politics/2026/07/23/as-the-2026-midterms-approach-economy-is-front-and-center/</link><description>现在，美国人在经济政策上最同意哪一个政党的问题上几乎是平分秋色：37% 的人认为是民主党，36% 的人认为是共和党。由 PolitePaul 服务提供</description><pubDate>Fri, 24 Jul 2026 07:40:35 GMT</pubDate><guid isPermaLink="true">https://www.pewresearch.org/politics/2026/07/23/as-the-2026-midterms-approach-economy-is-front-and-center/</guid></item><item><title>我们对 Polymarket 典型用户的了解</title><link>https://www.pewresearch.org/short-reads/2026/07/22/what-we-know-about-the-typical-polymarket-user/</link><description>在我们的研究期间，典型的 Polymarket 用户在 10 个活跃交易日内总共进行了 46 笔交易。由 PolitePaul 服务提供</description><pubDate>Fri, 24 Jul 2026 07:25:35 GMT</pubDate><guid isPermaLink="true">https://www.pewresearch.org/short-reads/2026/07/22/what-we-know-about-the-typical-polymarket-user/</guid></item><item><title>中等收入国家的人们如何看待美国削减人道主义援助？</title><link>https://www.pewresearch.org/short-reads/2026/07/21/what-do-people-in-middle-income-countries-think-about-cuts-to-us-humanitarian-aid/</link><description>在接受调查的 16 个中等收入国家中，许多人不确定美国人道主义援助削减将给他们带来什么影响，但持负面看法的人也不少。由 PolitePaul 服务提供</description><pubDate>Fri, 24 Jul 2026 07:10:35 GMT</pubDate><guid isPermaLink="true">https://www.pewresearch.org/short-reads/2026/07/21/what-do-people-in-middle-income-countries-think-about-cuts-to-us-humanitarian-aid/</guid></item></channel></rss>